## h2 Steps
  [p] The pages move over one weekend; the old wiki stays readable until the new one opens.
  [p] Read-only means read-only: the freeze covers comments too.
  [tr] Day | What
  [tr] Saturday | copy the pages
  [li] Done: Freeze edits on the old wiki
  [p] On Friday evening.
  [tr] Day | Pages
  [tr] Friday | 1,840
  [p] Nothing is edited after.
  [li] Copy the pages and check the links
  [p] Broken links first: the report.
  [li] Point the team's bookmarks at the new host
  [li] Close the old server
  [figcaption] bash
  [pre] Command: wiki export --all --out pages/
  [pre] 1840 pages written to pages/
  [pre] Command: linkcheck pages/
  [figcaption] zsh
  [pre] Command: wiki status
  [figcaption] sh
  [pre] Command: wiki status
  [figcaption] PowerShell
  [pre] Command: wiki status
  [figcaption] cmd
  [pre] Command: wiki status
  [figcaption] old-wiki.conf
  [pre] # Read-only from Friday evening
  [pre] read_only = true
  [pre] banner = "This wiki has moved to the new host."
  [pre] rsync --archive --delete --exclude '*.tmp' --exclude 'cache/' --log-file=copy.log old-wiki:/srv/wiki/pages/ /srv/new-wiki/pages/
