  [div] Warning: Heads up
  [p] Anyone editing during the freeze loses their changes; the plan and freeze.sh say when.
  [p] Saved drafts are lost too: the drafts and drafts.sh.
  [div] Note:
  [p] The new host is ready; the host and host.sh.
  [div] Problem:
  [p] Attachments over 1 MB failed; the list names each, and retry.sh sends them again.
  [div] Note:
  [p] The old wiki stays read-only; the wiki and wiki.sh.
  [div] Note:
  [p] The banner goes up on Friday; the banner and banner.sh.
