## h2 Choices
  [div] Copy in one go Recommended
  [p] Two days of read-only, as the plan says: export --all.
  [li] Pro: Simple
  [li] Con: Longer freeze
  [div] Copy by space
  [p] Each space is copied apart:
  [li] Docs first
  [li] Then the rest, as the plan says: export --space
  [li] Pro: Short freezes
  [li] Con: Links break between spaces
  [li] Con: Twice the work
  [p] decided 2030-03-28
  [div] The wiki moves to the new host
  [p] The old server is out of support in May.
  [tr] Host | Support
  [tr] Old | May
  [p] The new host is supported for five years.
  [p] Set aside
  [li] Stay on the old server
  [li] Move to a hosted wiki
